{
  "key": 19884,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_HaveMonForSavingUs",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! Hi! You’re not a Rocket!\n",
        "You came to save us?\f",
        "Why, thank you!\r",
        "I want you to have this Pokémon\n",
        "for saving us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_ReallyDangerousHere",
      "en_US": [
        "You!\n",
        "It’s really dangerous here!\r",
        "You came to save me?\n",
        "You can’t!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_RocketsAfterMasterBall",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Rocket was after the Master\n",
        "Ball, which catches any Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_BadIfTeamRocketTookOver",
      "en_US": [
        "It would be bad if Team Rocket\n",
        "took over Silph or our Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_FloorSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Silph Co. Head Office\n",
        "7F"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_RocketBossWentToBoardroom",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Rocket’s Boss went to the\n",
        "boardroom!\r",
        "Is our President okay?\n",
        "I’m worried."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_ObtainedLaprasFromEmployee",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} obtained a Lapras from\n",
        "the Silph employee!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_gText_NicknameThisPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_gText_NoMoreRoomForPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s no more room for Pokémon!\r",
        "The Pokémon Boxes are full and\n",
        "can’t accept any more!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_ThankYouSoMuch",
      "en_US": "Thank you so much!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_CanceledMasterBallProject",
      "en_US": [
        "We canceled the Master Ball\n",
        "project because of Team Rocket."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_WowYouChasedOffTeamRocket",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow!\r",
        "You chased off Team Rocket all by\n",
        "yourself?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_Text_TheDoorIsOpen",
      "en_US": "The door is open…"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_RivalWhatKeptYou",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: What kept you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_RivalIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hahaha! I thought you’d\n",
        "turn up if I waited here!\r",
        "I guess Team Rocket slowed you\n",
        "down! Not that I care!\r",
        "I saw you in Saffron, so I decided\n",
        "to see if you got better!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_RivalPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "I’m moving on up and ahead!\r",
        "By checking my Pokédex, I’m\n",
        "starting to see what’s strong and\f",
        "how they evolve!\r",
        "Am I a genius or what?\r",
        "I’ll get my last approvals, then\n",
        "boot out the Elite Four.\r",
        "Champion, and Leader of the Pallet\n",
        "Gym! Both of them, all mine!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, well, good luck to you!\n",
        "Don’t sweat it!\f",
        "Smell ya!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_SilphCo_7F_Text_ExplainLapras",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a Lapras.\n",
        "It’s a very intelligent Pokémon.\r",
        "We kept it in our lab, but it will\n",
        "be much better off with you.\r",
        "I think you will be a good Trainer\n",
        "for Lapras!\r",
        "It’s a good swimmer.\n",
        "It’ll give you a lift across water!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_Text_CardKeyOpenedDoor",
      "en_US": [
        "Bingo!\n",
        "The Card Key opened the door!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0897_CV_CANVAS_SILPH_CO_7F_Text_ItNeedsCardKey",
      "en_US": [
        "No!\n",
        "It needs a Card Key!"
      ]
    },
    {
